    "title": "Pairwise Comparisons Survey",
    "scenario": "After scheduling a closing (loan signing process) you want to find the notary's contact details. Ask where exactly they are displayed.",
    "header_description": "<p>You will listen to recordings of calls between a customer and a support agent. Each call is linked to a short scenario describing the customer's problem.</p>\n<p>You will hear <strong>two recordings about the same problem</strong>. Your task is to compare them and answer questions which audio is better according to different criteria. For example: <em>\u201cThe customer explained their problems clearly and correctly\u201d \u2014 does this statement align more with Recording 1, Recording 2, or equally with both?</em></p>\n<p>You will also see a transcript, but please listen carefully: some questions focus on tone of voice and other subtle differences that are only clear in the audio.</p>"
  },
